    "severity": "med",
    "area":"compare",
    "issue":"After editing a model (name or vendor), the compare bar chips retain the old text because refreshCompareBar() isn’t called after saveModel() updates the data.",
    "fix":"Add a call to refreshCompareBar() after render(true) in saveModel() (and similarly after any edit that changes display fields)."
  },
  {
    "severity": "low",
    "area":"ui",
    "issue":"Delta markup nests a <span class=\"delta ...\"> inside a <div class=\"delta\">, causing redundant CSS selectors and occasional layout shift.",
    "fix":"Replace the outer <div class=\"delta\"> with a plain <div> (or remove the inner span’s \"delta\" class) so only one element carries the styling."
  }
]

